# Source video for the Student Reviews page.
#
# Three reels are over three hundred megabytes. Git keeps them in history forever, so every
# clone and every deploy would pay for them permanently. They belong in the Media Library
# instead — uploaded once through the CRM, served from the server's media volume, and swappable
# without a deploy. The poster frames under public/images/reviews are committed: they are ~50 KB
# each and the page needs them immediately.
public/student review video/
